AddTest
├── when recipient is address(0)
│ └── it reverts with {InvalidRecipient}
├── when recipient is the zap
│ └── it reverts with {InvalidRecipient}
├── when deadline has passed
│ └── it reverts with {DeadlinePassed}
├── when amount1-only
│ └── it mints a position NFT to recipient and leaves the zap idle
├── when amount0-only
│ └── it mints a position NFT to recipient and leaves the zap idle
├── when both amounts are non-zero
│ └── it mints a position NFT to recipient and leaves the zap idle
├── when the pool is native
│ └── it mints a native position and leaves the zap idle
├── when the budget is single-sided
│ └── it returns only the slippage shortfall, in the input token
└── given the add succeeds
    └── it emits Added whose fields match the return values
